---
description: Kitchenary architecture and style rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow AGENTS.md in the repository root. In short: MVC with Provider; screens
only compose widgets; one widget per file; every colour comes from
`context.palette` (defined only in `lib/core/theme/app_colors.dart`); services
sit behind interfaces; package imports only; `flutter analyze` and
`flutter test` must pass before you finish.
